  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "o01",
      "visual": "notebook-hook",
      "from": 0,
      "duration": 168,
      "text": {
        "en": "A blind patient reached for a notebook. How did light help him find it?",
        "zh": "一位失明的人，怎么又找到了桌上的笔记本？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o02",
      "visual": "algae",
      "from": 168,
      "duration": 221,
      "text": {
        "en": "The clue starts with tiny algae. Shine a light, and they swim toward it.",
        "zh": "线索，竟然藏在绿藻里。光一照，它们就朝着光游过去。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o03",
      "visual": "gate",
      "from": 389,
      "duration": 230,
      "text": {
        "en": "Scientists found a door that light could open. Put it in other cells, and light could trigger a signal.",
        "zh": "科学家找到了会被光打开的门。装进别的细胞，光就能让它发出信号。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o04",
      "visual": "camera",
      "from": 619,
      "duration": 201,
      "text": {
        "en": "This patient’s light-sensing cells had failed. But other cells that could pass signals along were still there.",
        "zh": "这位病人的感光细胞坏了，后面传信的细胞，却还在。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o05",
      "visual": "amber",
      "from": 820,
      "duration": 203,
      "text": {
        "en": "The team gave those cells another kind of light switch, one that responds to amber light.",
        "zh": "研究团队给那些细胞装上另一种光开关。琥珀色的光，就能把它打开。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o06",
      "visual": "encode",
      "from": 1023,
      "duration": 192,
      "text": {
        "en": "Special glasses turn changes in brightness into pulses of light. That is encoding.",
        "zh": "特制眼镜把明暗变化，变成一闪一闪的光点。这叫编码。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o07",
      "visual": "decode",
      "from": 1215,
      "duration": 160,
      "text": {
        "en": "The brain learns to read those signals as objects. That is decoding.",
        "zh": "大脑再学着把光信号读成东西的样子。这叫解码。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o08",
      "visual": "touch",
      "from": 1375,
      "duration": 160,
      "text": {
        "en": "After months of training, he could locate some objects and reach out to touch them.",
        "zh": "练了几个月，他能找到一些物体，还能伸手去摸。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o09",
      "visual": "limits",
      "from": 1535,
      "duration": 220,
      "text": {
        "en": "This was partial recovery in one patient. He still needed the glasses, and normal vision had not returned.",
        "zh": "这是一位病人的部分恢复。他仍需要眼镜，也没恢复正常视力。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o10",
      "visual": "brain",
      "from": 1755,
      "duration": 185,
      "text": {
        "en": "Starting with a light signal, we can explore how the brain processes information.",
        "zh": "从一个光信号开始，我们能一点点研究大脑怎样处理信息。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "o11",
      "visual": "question",
      "from": 1940,
      "duration": 303,
      "text": {
        "en": "At Lucas Academy, we explore step by step: how do brains think, and how does AI learn?",
        "zh": "在 Lucas Academy，我们一起一点点探索：大脑如何思考，AI 又如何学习？"
      }
    }
  ],
